{"format":2,"id":"bayou","name":"Plaine de Bayou","description":"La ville fortifiée de Bayou, ceinte de remparts (porte double à l'est, poterne à l'ouest, escaliers vers le chemin de ronde), garde une rivière franchie par un pont et deux gués. À l'est s'étend une vaste plaine vallonnée, faite pour la cavalerie, avec une colline centrale et un village ; au nord, le pied des montagnes et ses forêts ; au sud-est, des bois épais où une armée peut attendre son heure.","author":"Kingdom Battleground","updatedAt":"2026-11-21T02:05:33.013Z","background":null,"height":{"0,0":7,"0,1":6,"0,2":6,"0,3":5,"0,4":4,"0,5":3,"0,6":2,"0,7":2,"0,8":2,"0,9":2,"0,10":2,"0,11":2,"0,12":2,"0,13":2,"0,14":2,"0,15":2,"0,16":2,"0,17":2,"0,18":2,"0,19":2,"0,20":2,"0,21":2,"0,22":2,"0,23":2,"0,24":2,"0,25":2,"0,26":2,"0,27":2,"0,28":2,"0,29":2,"0,30":2,"0,31":2,"0,32":2,"0,33":2,"0,34":2,"0,35":2,"0,36":2,"0,37":2,"0,38":2,"0,39":2,"1,0":7,"1,1":6,"1,2":5,"1,3":4,"1,4":3,"1,5":2,"1,6":2,"1,7":2,"1,8":2,"1,9":2,"1,10":2,"1,11":2,"1,12":2,"1,13":2,"1,14":2,"1,15":2,"1,16":2,"1,17":2,"1,18":2,"1,19":2,"1,20":2,"1,21":2,"1,22":2,"1,23":2,"1,24":2,"1,25":2,"1,26":2,"1,27":2,"1,28":3,"1,29":3,"1,30":3,"1,31":3,"1,32":2,"1,33":2,"1,34":2,"1,35":2,"1,36":2,"1,37":2,"1,38":2,"1,39":2,"2,-1":7,"2,0":6,"2,1":5,"2,2":4,"2,3":3,"2,4":2,"2,5":2,"2,6":2,"2,7":2,"2,8":2,"2,9":2,"2,10":2,"2,11":2,"2,12":2,"2,13":2,"2,14":2,"2,15":2,"2,16":2,"2,17":2,"2,18":2,"2,19":2,"2,20":2,"2,21":2,"2,22":2,"2,23":2,"2,24":2,"2,25":2,"2,26":2,"2,27":3,"2,28":3,"2,29":3,"2,30":3,"2,31":3,"2,32":2,"2,33":2,"2,34":2,"2,35":2,"2,36":2,"2,37":2,"2,38":2,"3,-1":6,"3,0":6,"3,1":5,"3,2":4,"3,3":3,"3,4":2,"3,5":2,"3,6":2,"3,7":2,"3,8":2,"3,9":2,"3,10":2,"3,11":2,"3,12":2,"3,13":2,"3,14":2,"3,15":2,"3,16":2,"3,17":2,"3,18":2,"3,19":2,"3,20":2,"3,21":2,"3,22":2,"3,23":2,"3,24":2,"3,25":2,"3,26":3,"3,27":3,"3,28":3,"3,29":3,"3,30":3,"3,31":3,"3,32":3,"3,33":2,"3,34":2,"3,35":2,"3,36":2,"3,37":2,"3,38":2,"4,-2":7,"4,-1":6,"4,0":5,"4,1":4